;Future appearances
Shawn Johnson, Gilles Marini, and Melissa Rycroft later competed in the [[Dancing with the Stars (American season 15)|All-Stars]] season, where Johnson was paired with Derek Hough, Marini was paired with [[Peta Murgatroyd]], and Rycroft remained with Tony Dovolani.

===Host and judges===
The show was again co-hosted by [[Tom Bergeron]] and [[Samantha Harris]]. [[Len Goodman]], [[Bruno Tonioli]] and [[Carrie Ann Inaba]] returned as judges.

